          "start": 7.05,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "or emails in different languages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 14.04,
          "en": "And ChatGPT can be a great helper in such cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.04,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "Same thing applies to tone adjustment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "As mentioned earlier, I'm not a native English speaker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "Therefore, if I write an email to a colleague,",
